{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3b6cbddbc688fa4191dbf42dd8dcf90a565df5e34f145bd73f00455103ec0db7", "ja": "環、お疲れさま。\nあれ？　その衣装、また試着してるのか？", "zh": "环，辛苦了。\n咦？你又在试那套服装了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "bfcfac25751ad7bd600353594f5019027b22cdb1e7eabb2b888386678bddb432", "ja": "あっ、おやぶん！？\nうう～、見つかっちゃった……。", "zh": "啊，老大！？\n呜呜～被发现了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1002_p", "source_sha256": "93b2d3fcaff0f0328b3a51a0a00ba3ce57425cb3b90114ce2677a835139f443b", "ja": "いや、試着くらい何回しても構わないけど……\nブログで恥ずかしがってたのが、気になってたしな。", "zh": "没事啦，你要试穿几次都没关系……\n你在部落格上表现得很害羞，我也有点担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a0ed98604e87654e1937b6fb20fa92b8fdf6b739f893e8766d403f0570c92e91", "ja": "どうだ、その衣装。気に入ったか？", "zh": "那套服装怎么样？你喜欢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "d0d34a57cdd60381067326931bc18e9b6a874225e11b36f403678b0835357b0f", "ja": "うん。まだちょっとだけ、恥ずかしいけど……\nでもたまき、衣装は気に入ってるぞ！", "zh": "嗯，虽然还有点难为情……\n但环很喜欢这套服装喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "38ba91a7c74659bde8a1e41536c98a9f87e11e8dd19b296d60113612119db5f5", "ja": "これ、ズボンよりスースーするけど、\nふつうのスカートより動きやすい！", "zh": "这个穿起来虽然比裤子还凉飕飕，\n但比一般的裙子更好活动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1006_p", "source_sha256": "df72f4e32a07e3999dfce3e69679c76c9789d3de84c662ebe581914bef6f32d9", "ja": "そこは、アイドルの衣装だからな。\n普通の服より、動きやすく作ってあるはずだよ。", "zh": "毕竟是做给偶像穿的服装。\n当然要比一般的衣服更好活动啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "b508eef84a630a4c0c6e129023ff004360c663aa67aacca55fca316f0c23240a", "ja": "たまきのお母さんもね、よく、\nこういう服をたまきに着せようとするんだ～。", "zh": "环的妈妈也是，\n常常会想让环穿这种衣服～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "d15508d3d608a5f320972949246edcfe714c03056a16084bd35bf3f4c8a4df34", "ja": "お誕生日会に、ひらひらしたドレスみたいなのとか。\nすそ踏んじゃって、転んでばっかりだった……。", "zh": "像生日派对时，她会要环穿缝满花边的礼服。\n但环走路会踩到下摆，一直跌倒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "497d95a0cae4a487dc45c92732b2907d088dc3fc5f10f6133bc4b7a500dfeae3", "ja": "それに、木登りしてひっかけちゃったから、\n結局すぐに脱いじゃったんだ。", "zh": "而且环去爬树时还勾到，\n结果还是马上就换下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d7d38370e659b7682adeb6c7a8c4c1a44913e8ab890a265b1a8fec14648121ca", "ja": "そういえば……前に、スカートを破いて\n怒られたって言ってたな。そうか、誕生日の……。", "zh": "说起来……你以前有讲过自己弄破裙子\n被凶了一顿对吧？原来是生日的时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0737302aaa71691b889f00896c48db56ef7c90d86a91335fef7e5da3a3f661b8", "ja": "ドレスで木登りするのは危ないから、\nやめておいた方がいいな。", "zh": "穿礼服爬树是很危险的，\n你以后还是别这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "87ec0ff67817db10777ee3c7709998374c6bfed2d19df5465989e608b575c9de", "ja": "うん。たまき、もうやらない……。", "zh": "嗯，环不会再那样了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "5a0a1252e3e71c706daf194cd8c0cd5e00175182194aba6139a67f3a8dee4f1f", "ja": "あのね、おやぶん。たまきに衣装くれてありがとー！\nすっごくうれしかった！", "zh": "那个呀，老大，谢谢你送环这套服装──！\n环真的很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0010758c31bb68665c63284d60814cd3c05ac2606da88929eeb904ff850c7805", "ja": "それならよかった！　あとは環のファンのみんなが\n喜んでくれたら、言うことなしだな。", "zh": "那就好！再来只要环的粉丝也喜欢，\n那就没什么好担心的了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "de709df65bb2b2475aa807f10412902d20ec8a3d83c8a3fed7a3c3b72bcca376", "ja": "くふふ、なんかヘンだね！　衣装もらったのは\nたまきなのに、ファンのみんながよろこぶの？", "zh": "呵呵，感觉真奇怪！\n收到服装的明明是环，粉丝怎么会觉得开心啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1016_p", "source_sha256": "308358f97139e549aeae374a2486215dd797e031aece82b9ae88f649ba686b6a", "ja": "そうだな。環にしてみれば、ちょっと不思議な事かも\nしれないけど……でも、ファンは嬉しいはずだよ。", "zh": "这个嘛，虽然从环的角度来看，这样或许是\n有点难以理解没错……不过，粉丝应该会很开心喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1017_p", "source_sha256": "9668d9f1c4dec943219f280cd8c43136de593b4eed97d02f523e391b9ad3cf3e", "ja": "応援しているアイドルが輝くところを\n見られるのは、いつだって嬉しいものだからな！", "zh": "毕竟能看到自己支持的偶像发光发热，\n会觉得开心也是很正常的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "de21437fb707aa7ec9ba8e4569b90f0cd9ae65df7ffd0f31a45d0b981f3f69c8", "ja": "ふーん……それって、おやぶんも？\nおやぶんも、たまきが新しい衣装着てたらうれしい？", "zh": "嗯……那么老大也是？\n老大看到环穿新服装也很开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1019_p", "source_sha256": "87c21a6fac48807e647b8cdc3c8b8e7a005bd0ad4ff58e35a949c63db3791150", "ja": "もちろん、嬉しいぞ！　何と言っても、\nプロデューサーはアイドルの最初のファンだからな。", "zh": "当然开心啊！\n毕竟制作人就是偶像的头号粉丝呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "3f8ee8144243fcd33c90058f87b037d3fd7a9dbc185cd5c969f082a4fc46c07f", "ja": "くふふ、そっか。おやぶんやみんながうれしいなら、\nたまきも、もっともーっとうれしいぞー！", "zh": "呵呵，这样啊。既然老大和大家都会开心，\n那环要更更更～开心──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1021_p", "source_sha256": "88c5925f645675f8407a6fe59f0913a52c706012d7109f97b1b31b24b253265e", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nその事を、ずっと忘れないでいような。", "zh": "嗯，就是这样。\n要一直把这件事放在心上喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "0c97e5d9455159d7bbba7f5802b08d52a8873c3774553b71637276d1ac10271c", "ja": "うん……わかった！\nたまき、ちゃんと覚えておくね！", "zh": "嗯……环知道了！\n环会好好记住的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "a5498af78582e308563ce6d19920fbf34b1dfb0ab035132bcec5fe30ef4bd3de", "ja": "そっか～、たまきがうれしいとみんなもうれしいんだ。\nじゃあたまきが楽しいと、みんなも楽しいかな……？", "zh": "原来～环觉得开心大家也会觉得开心。\n那环要是觉得快乐，大家也会觉得快乐吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "826b8b0a2d48966883ad896e51fe24ff5fadbdc722eace165d8e31a8d77f4e92", "ja": "おー、なんかすごいぞー！？\n次のライブ楽しみだね、おやぶん！　くふふ……♪", "zh": "喔～好像很厉害耶──！\n真叫人期待下次的演唱会呢，老大！呵呵……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0074_1025_p", "source_sha256": "9cef82128842ca0e45bfdedf6dd61a3ddef5333a40229386775061a1e8af26d3", "ja": "（アイドルとして活動しながら環は日々成長している。\nそれに寄り添えるのが、一番嬉しい事かもな）", "zh": "（从事偶像活动的环每天都有所成长。\n能在旁见证这一过程，或许就是最让人开心的事了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
